    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math feels like a bridge between abstract concepts and real-world logic. While I enjoy its structure—especially its problem-solving nature—I struggle with memorization-heavy topics like complex equations, which can feel overwhelming. My high openness score (96) makes me more curious about applications in arts and tech than rote exercises. However, as a student of computer science, I find it essential for coding and analysis.",
